{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20225","headline":"峡哀 一 · 孟郊","name":"峡哀 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔多相与笑，今谁相与哀。\n峡哀哭幽魂，噭噭风吹来。\n堕魄抱空月，出没难自裁。\n齑粉一闪间，春涛百丈雷。\n峡水声不平，碧沲牵清洄。\n沙棱箭箭急，波齿齗齗开。\n呀彼无底吮，待此不测灾。\n谷号相喷激，石怒争旋回。\n古醉有复乡，今缧多爲能。\n字孤徒髣髴，衔雪犹惊猜。\n薄俗少直肠，交结须横财。\n黄金买相吊，幽泣无余漼。\n我有古心意，爲君空摧颓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20225.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20225","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}